#: modules/landing/components/Page.tsx:140
msgid "Humans clone from README.md (setup, how-tos, bootstrap prompt). Agents follow AGENTS.md and .cursor/rules/ while writing code. Do not merge those files — keep them consistent."
msgstr "İnsanlar README.md’den clone eder (kurulum, how-to’lar, bootstrap prompt). Agent’lar kod yazarken AGENTS.md ve .cursor/rules/ izler. Bu dosyaları birleştirmeyin — tutarlı tutun."

